the SaveData is a set.
this's Path is a text.

the Game is an actor.
this's State is a SaveData.

this can Save.
this's Save does...
    lock this's State...
        when this's State exists?
            this is ok with this's State!
        or?
            this is failed with error "no state"!

    finally...
        log "save attempt complete".

the App is a script.

Game's State is a SaveData with Path "/p".

do Game's Save...
    when ok?
        log that's Path.
    or?
        log that's error.
